Package: icee-dev-mipsel-cross
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for Ice-E (for cross-compiling)
 Ice-E ("Embedded Ice") is a compact communications engine
 designed specifically for use in environments where resources are
 scarce, such as Internet-enabled smart phones, personal digital
 assistants (PDAs), and embedded controllers. This package provides
 the development files for cross-compiling.
